    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36252" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">picris</span></b> , ĭdis,
		f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πικρίς</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Bitter lettuce</i>, a kind of salad (in Greek
			letters, <i><span class="en">Plin. 19, 8, 38, §
			126</span></i>).—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A plant that blooms all the year round</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 21,
				17, 65, § 105</span></i>.</div>
